(KINGDOMINO - Demo Rulebook \(Board Game Cafe\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OVERVIEW) Tj T*
(Players build a 5 x 5 kingdom from dominoes. Each domino has two terrain squares.) Tj T*
(Crowns on the squares multiply the value of your territories.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SETUP) Tj T*
(Each player takes a castle tile and a king. With 2 players each player uses 2 kings) Tj T*
(and 24 dominoes are used; with 3 players use 36 dominoes; with 4 players use all 48.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A TURN) Tj T*
(Dominoes are numbered on the back; low numbers are less valuable. Lay out a line of) Tj T*
(new dominoes \(as many as kings\) sorted by number. In the order of the kings on the) Tj T*
(current line, each player:) Tj T*
(1. adds the domino under their king to their kingdom, then) Tj T*
(2. places their king on a domino of the new line.) Tj T*
(The position on the new line decides the order of the next turn: a lower number plays) Tj T*
(earlier.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
