(CONNECTION RULES) Tj T*
(A domino must touch your castle \(any terrain\) or a domino with at least one matching) Tj T*
(terrain. The kingdom must fit in a 5 x 5 grid, castle included. If you can not place a) Tj T*
(domino legally, you discard it.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(SCORING) Tj T*
(A territory is a group of connected squares of the same terrain. Each territory scores) Tj T*
(its number of squares multiplied by the number of crowns in it. A territory without) Tj T*
(crowns scores 0.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(OPTIONAL BONUSES) Tj T*
(- Middle Kingdom: 10 points if your castle is in the center of your 5 x 5 kingdom.) Tj T*
(- Harmony: 5 points if your kingdom is complete and no domino was discarded.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(WINNER) Tj T*
(The most points wins. On a tie, the player with the largest territory wins, then the) Tj T*
(player with the most crowns.) Tj T*
ET
endstream
